t-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;font-size: 12px;font-weight: bold;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);text-align: left\">编辑｜茹曼怡</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);text-align: center;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: transparent;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);text-align: center;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: transparent;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span class=\"wx_text_underline\">01</span></span></span></p><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"color: rgb(47, 118, 195);font-weight: bold\">妈阁引路人</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">那年春天，是动物交配的季节。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">公司美女经理兰姐点名让我陪她去澳门出差，我也好奇，赌场里究竟是个什么样的。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">早上8点，深圳蛇口码头的晨雾还未散去，我和兰姐登上前往澳门氹仔码头的邮轮。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">海浪有节奏的拍打着船舷，航行一个小时后，兰姐兴奋地指向窗外：</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「快看！那里就是澳门！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">很快，氹仔客运码头就映入眼帘。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">兰姐是澳门通，<span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">下了邮轮，她熟门熟路带着我钻进一辆标着「澳门威尼斯人」的发财巴士。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">发财车摇摇晃晃地载着我们前往赌场，下车瞬间，看着眼前的豪华建筑群，我恍如隔世，这哪是赌场？分明就是宫殿！</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">走进金碧辉煌的威尼斯人，兰姐竟一溜烟地消失了！</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span><section><section style=\"display: inline-block\"><img data-ratio=\"1\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/enu35DRIiaThKBA48qShtoGEmZrXBw0IXqSaibhSkd3ZwR8e5Tw5APIMfCgBQibmCRicl9unRL72VwVOeibzw8DBbrw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"height: auto !important\"/></section></section><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我在中场里晃荡，一台台老虎机的屏幕泛着幽蓝，轮盘的象牙球滚动时发出清脆的叮咚声，一切都很魔幻。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">逛</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">了一大圈，我终于在一张败家乐赌台发现了兰姐的身影。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">兰姐坐在赌台前，也发现了身后的我，我刚想开口，她就抢先一步，压低声音说道：</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「你先听我说，别靠我太近，看着就行，别和我搭话，赢了我请吃饭」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我小鸡啄米般点点头。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">荷官示意下注，疑惑的是兰姐的目光盯的不是路单屏幕，而是坐在5号位的胖子赌客。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">那胖子头发冒油，印堂发黑，犹豫两秒后，把1万码压在了庄上。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">兰姐看准时机，把1万码压在闲上，胖子愣了一下，瞥了眼兰姐。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">买定离手，荷官把庄闲两家牌分别推到胖子和兰姐面前，兰姐看都不看，直接翻开，2+5，闲7点。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「7点！赢定啦！」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">兰姐朝着胖子喊，言语中带着挑衅。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">胖子也不甘示弱，回怼兰姐：</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「7点很大吗？有8点的嘛！」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">胖子随手翻出一张Q，正想翻开第二张之际，兰姐对着那张庄牌喊：</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「公！公！公！」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">胖子咬牙切齿，捻着手中的纸牌大声喊：</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「三边！三边！三边！」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">牌开了，一张K！胖子还要博一张牌。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「庄博」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">荷官把一张补牌推到胖子面前。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">胖子掀开一侧，是张四边牌，他歇斯底里地喊：</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「吹！吹！吹啊！」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">兰姐索性站了起来，双手激动的拍打着赌台绒布：</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「杀！杀！杀！」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">牌开了，一张10，庄0点，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">胖子输了。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">胖子怒不可遏，颤抖的手握着最后2万筹码，全部梭哈到闲上。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">兰姐见状，把2万压在庄上。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">胖子立马回撤筹码，又压在庄上。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">兰姐也收回筹码，压在闲上。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「臭X，你他妈德！想干什么啊？」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">胖子终于是对着兰姐爆了一句国粹。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">兰姐也不示弱，转过头对身后的赌客说道：</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「喂，有灯不跟，输到卖身啊！」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">话毕，所有围台的老哥纷纷把注码压在了胖子的对家。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">此时的我也想参与，但摸着自己口袋的300港币，连上台的资格都没有。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">也罢，观摩他们对赌可比自己下场要刺激多了。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">众人买定后，荷官开始派牌。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">兰姐还是非常淡定，直接把两张闲牌翻开，A+8，9点！</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「耶！一枪过！」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">胖子看着欢呼的众人，生无可恋翻开第一张庄牌，一张4，随后又像抓住救命稻草，捻着第二张牌：</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「两边！两边！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">兰姐带领众人齐声喊：</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「剪！剪他的边！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">果然是张两边牌，胖子对着牌喊：</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「顶！顶！顶！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">兰姐更是直接凑近胖子的耳边：</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「吹！吹！吹！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">那唾沫星子都溅到了胖子的脸上。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">胖子最后用尽全力把那张牌甩在赌台的绒布上，还是一张4！</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「8输9，经常有哈！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">在众人的笑声中，胖子瘫坐在椅子上，面无表情地看着天花板，随后又恶狠狠地瞪向兰姐。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">兰姐收好筹码，拉着我的胳膊：</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「飞龙，我们赶紧走！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/><section style=\"text-align: center\"><section style=\"display: inline-block\"></section><span style=\"background-color: transparent;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left\">02</span></section></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;color: rgb(47, 118, 195)\">澳门女「赌神」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">我还没问去哪，兰姐就一路把我拉到了购物中心——四季名店，<span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">走进一家超大的LV，各种奢侈品琳琅满目。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「好看吗？」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">镜子里，兰姐把包包试挎在右手手腕，左手拨动着发丝，随口问我。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">看着镜子里风韵犹存的兰姐，我说，<span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">兰姐你可真好看！</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「我说这个包！你想哪去啦？」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">兰姐俏皮地嘟了嘟嘴。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">我才回过神来，看了眼价格，2万8千多，这么贵！</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「不止，这款还要配货，没有小4万拿不下来」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">兰姐有些不舍的把包包放回原处，又拉着我返回赌场，说得找庄家报销。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">我们走进高额区，一张赌台传来潮水般的欢呼声，兰姐快步走了过去。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/><section><section style=\"display: inline-block\"><img data-ratio=\"1\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/enu35DRIiaTiaI3rIx4UmL0m8GkMRpD5nwIf73IVQiaJE0xVfIyMIlcicT2PH3QJlReDVqcwNpGut7NPkpsIlcac9g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"height: auto !important\"/></section></section></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">听围观的赌客兴奋说，一位大哥手气很好，赢了几口，大概有80万，兰姐不禁向那位大哥投去羡慕的眼神。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">兰姐拉低了衣领，露出傲人的大杀器，在大哥身旁坐下，跟大哥搭讪：</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「哥，你手气这么好，带带妹妹呗！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">赌钱的人大多不喜欢带别人，怕搭沉船，影响自己的运气，但<span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">大哥看着楚楚可怜的兰姐，不让她跟注，倒显得不解风情：</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「美女啊，你相信哥的话，今天就跟着哥发财！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「谢谢哥！哥肯定发大财！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">兰姐谄媚地笑了笑，与之前对待胖子的态度发生了180度的旋转。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">说时迟那时快，大哥下注10万压闲，看了兰姐一眼，兰姐也跟注1万。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">荷官发牌，大哥眯牌，2+3，闲5点。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">庄K+2，2点，根据规则，两家都要补牌。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">大哥眯着闲补，兰姐就在一旁喊：</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「两边！两边！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">扑克牌掀开一侧，是三边，大哥呼出一口浊气，有些失望，兰姐随即安慰道：</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「没事哥，3点照样赢他」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「顶！顶！顶！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">可当闲补翻开时，却是一张7，闲2点，这把牌相当悬。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">紧接着兰姐朝庄补卖力喊：</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「四边！四边！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">庄补开了，一张肥婆8，庄0点，闲2点，闲赢！</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">大哥与兰姐一番欢呼雀跃后，随手打赏了兰姐5000茶钱：</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「不错喔美女，跟我合财，再玩几把呗！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">兰姐接过小费，站起身来：</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「谢谢哥，我就不玩了哈」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">离开高额区，我纳闷兰姐怎么不乘胜追击？</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「刚才那一把已经很悬了，要是大哥下一把输了，肯定会怪我的」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">兰姐说在赌场里，要懂得见好就收。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">在账房，兰姐把赢来的筹码换成了港币，港币又换成了LV牛皮包，人也开始飘了，她拉着我的手：</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">「小龙，跟我混澳门，百万不算富，千万刚起步！哈哈哈！」</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">俨然一副澳门女赌神的姿态。</section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><br/></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">到了晚上，为了省钱，我和兰姐共处一间房，她睡房间，我睡客厅。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">我看着窗外的澳门夜景，霓虹灯将整个赌城照耀得如玉皇大帝的天宫，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">一种寂寞感莫名袭来，翻来覆去睡不着。</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">让我意外的是，兰姐睡觉居然没关门，我试探性喊了一声：</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「兰姐，客厅好像有蚊子……」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「啊？房间里没有耶，要不……你进来睡？」</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我内心挣扎着，见我迟迟没有动静，兰姐又催促：</span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「进不进来？不进来活该你让蚊子咬！」</span></section><p class=\"js_pay_preview_filter\"><mp-pay-preview-filter data-offset=\"184\"></mp-pay-preview-filter></p></div>',NULL,NULL,'published',0,107,0,NULL,'2025-09-07 15:36:37','2025-09-07 23:24:37','2026-07-31 22:39:37'),(50,4,2,'澳门女公关：赌厅里没有同胞，只有待宰的钱包','macau-hostess-casino-story',NULL,'<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content defaultNoSetting\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"-webkit-\"><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">澳门合集第239篇（239/999）</span></p><section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.5em;\'><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 17px;visibility: visible\"><br style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible\"/></span></section><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;\'><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(102, 102, 102);font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;line-height: 24px;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 8px 0px 0px;padding: 4px 10px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);border-radius: 5px;background-color: rgb(171, 219, 171);visibility: visible\">公众号</span></strong><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;line-height: 24px;color: rgb(127, 127, 127);visibility: visible\"><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible\">秋淑曼 出品</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;font-size: 12px;font-weight: bold;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);text-align: left\"></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: 12px;font-weight: bold;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);text-align: center;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: rgb(47, 118, 195);font-weight: bold;letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);font-size: var(--articleFontsize)\">前言</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);text-align: left;font-size: 17px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">澳门钜星贵宾厅里，叠码仔旷哥托着700万筹码，朝一位大客信步走来。</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;text-align: left;font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.578px\">接过筹码的大客，50左右的年纪，气宇非凡，留着时髦的平头，颇有儒将风范</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.578px\">，身后簇拥着</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">几个雕龙画虎的马仔，实属有排面。</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">不一会儿，空荡荡的赌厅就涌入几十号人，他们不是普通人，都是澳门吃台底的老板，合股来吃大客的台底暗庄。</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">那些人坐在大客身后，大气不敢喘，仿佛空气被抽干了一般。</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">赌枱上的荷官尽管见惯大场面，但对面的大客，眼神中自带杀气，也未免紧张起来。</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">牌局开始，大客随手扔上5万买闲，身后的老板们喉结滚动，这不是单纯的赌局，台底还有100倍的杠杆。</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">大客这口输了，他们刚松下一口气，心又再次提到了嗓子眼，因为大客把20万压上了闲。</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">要是闲赢，他们这伙人台底就要输掉2000万。</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">几口有惊无险过后，大客把100万压在庄上，身后几位台底老板满头大汗，当场身子一软，差点瘫倒在地毯上……</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">刚入职澳门贵宾厅公关时，导师欣姐就跟我讲起这段赌厅往事。</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">欣姐说，那是澳门史上最大的台底，大客最终台上输了700万，台下输了7个亿。</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我问欣姐，那位大客是谁？现在过得怎么样？</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「他是四川汉龙集团董事长刘汉，豪赌过后没几年，花生米就穿透了他的后颈」</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">欣姐说，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">那场赌局最大赢家，自然是那些吃台底的老板们。</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">澳门是赌城，一个充满各种游戏规则的地方，不管你多有钱有势，在这里，没有同胞，只有钱包。</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><section><section style=\"display: inline-block\"><img data-ratio=\"0.562037037037037\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/enu35DRIiaTjqkvRMlV91L4JsHWSeZ5gj6xwWR5nDl7Qq1ed37mHkqke3k5ZT0sGweTE6hNmncrWdicOVibDnGw8g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"height: auto !important\"/></section></section><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: 12px;font-weight: bold;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">口述｜刘娇娇</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;font-size: 12px;font-weight: bold;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);text-align: left\">编辑｜茹曼怡</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);text-align: center;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: transparent;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span class=\"wx_text_underline\">01</span></span><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);text-align: center;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: transparent;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);text-align: justify\"><br style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-align: left\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;color: rgb(47, 118, 195)\">特殊的客人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);text-align: left;font-size: 17px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我是刘娇娇，英文名jojo，那年我青葱欲滴，满心憧憬在澳门贵宾厅当公关，黑色制服口袋里永远装着三件套：</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><br/></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\">客户爱好备忘录，港币现金，以及一只精美的打火机。</p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><br/></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\">你要问我什么是赌厅公关？</p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><br/></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\">这一行是青春饭，要求体态妖娆，妆容精致，好听点是赌场的知客，俗一点就叫陪赌女郎。</p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><br/></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\">我们陪伴在赌客身旁，不分昼夜，24小时待命，拿着高额提成的同时，面对赌客的刁难或垂涎，也必须游刃有余，背后的心酸只有自己知道。</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);text-align: left;font-size: 17px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">那年夏季，天空飘着小雨，拱北口岸却人潮涌动，各家赌场的穿梭大巴</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">轮番等候着幻想发财的赌徒。</span></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><br/></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\">当上海的周生提着爱马仕行李箱踏出关闸，犹豫着要不要冒雨继续前行时，我踩着细高跟打着伞凑了过来：</p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><br/></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\">「周生，我是xx的公关经理jojo，欢迎来到澳门！」</p><p style=\"visibility: visible\"><br/></p><p style=\"visibility: visible\">我热情地用普通话招徕，将周生迎至自家赌厅的威尔法专车上。</p><p><br/></p><p>到达富丽堂皇的赌场酒店门口，劳斯莱斯幻影，宾利慕尚，迈巴赫S级等超豪轿车也载着各路神秘赌客直通赌场贵宾厅。</p><p><br/></p><p>乘坐专属电梯进入私人厅内，环顾四周，几乎每张台子都人声鼎沸，掺夹着粤语，蜀音，东北话，吴侬软语等各种方言的叫喊声。</p><p><br/></p><p>这时一位穿西装打领带，一副专业人士模样的男人迎面走来：</p><p><br/></p><p>「周生，好久不见，今天一定要赢多点喔！」</p><p><br/></p><p>这男人便是周生的叠码仔熙哥。</p><p><br/></p><p>熙哥让我从账房签出300万给周生娱乐，并<span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">吩咐我一定要好好招待周生。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">周生是位特殊的客人，人长得高大帅气，不输发哥，但打牌时却异常安静，更不喜欢有人围台，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我只能站在他身后端茶倒水伺候着。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.578px\">电子牌路显示一庄两闲开了两组，又飞出一口庄，下一口应该是开闲，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.578px\">我</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">细细地打量着周生，他却把10万压在了庄上。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">荷官机械般的发牌，闲牌7点，周生眯庄牌，一张电视机，一张三边。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">「顶满，一枪过！」</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">我在身后给他加油打气。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">只见他低头皱着眉，注意力全在纸牌上。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">牌开了，庄8闲7，周生赢了，但</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">从发牌到派彩，由</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">始至终他都没认真看过我一眼。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我精心打扮，站到腿软，他却视我为空气，心想这人怎么那么拽，一点都不懂得怜香惜玉。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">两个小时后，周生抬手看了看百达翡丽上雕刻的时间，此时正是饭点，周生突然转过头，盯着我的工牌开口询问：</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「你叫jojo？陪我去外面吃饭吧」</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我有些惊讶，贵宾厅里24小时提供餐饮服务，8大菜系色香味一流，很少赌客会在开工期间离开赌厅。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">在米其林三星法餐厅用餐，周生像雕塑般严肃地看着手机，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">我如同古代丫鬟那样，贴心地把菜夹到他碗里，生怕他吃不好。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">或许是这个不经意的举动，周生竟抬起头</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">问我待会有没有时间？陪他去购物送给朋友。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">作为周生的专属公关，我自然没有拒绝的理由。</span></p><p><br/></p><section><section style=\"display: inline-block\"><img data-ratio=\"1\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/enu35DRIiaTgukRIS28rqG8adeoKdJwIPvKVN8qt8T7G1hMJ1FtsicfpWzYCQv88ib1k2QAr0Siau3ULzfNmD1DvYQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"height: auto !important\"/></section></section><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span><br/></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);text-align: center;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: transparent;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span class=\"wx_text_underline\">02</span></span><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);text-align: center;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: transparent;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);text-align: justify\"><br style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-align: left\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;color: rgb(47, 118, 195)\">真诚的套路</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);text-align: left;font-size: 17px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">在CHANEL、LV、GUCCI逛了一圈，导购小姐们异常热情，疯狂向贵气逼人的周生推销当季最新款。</span></p><p><br/></p><p>我从试衣间出来，周生眼里多了一丝不易察觉的光：</p><p><br/></p><p>「你穿红色真好看！」</p><p><br/></p><p>他说相信我的品味，最终<span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">买下一堆价值20多万的奢侈品。</span></p><p><br/></p><p>回到酒店后，周生把那几袋名牌衣服鞋子包包递给我：</p><p><br/></p><p>「jojo，这些礼物送给你，我喜欢你，能不能做我的女朋友？」</p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">周生说对我一见钟情，我是他喜欢的类型。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">这忽如其来的表白让我彻底失了神。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">看上我的豪客，扔下10万陪3天的也不是没遇过，我不是看不上钱，只是不屑那些人。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">但面对高大帅气又多金，懂浪漫又真诚的周生，我</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">犹豫几秒后，还是沦陷了，幻想着过上幸福的生活。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><section><section style=\"display: inline-block\"><img data-ratio=\"1\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/enu35DRIiaTgukRIS28rqG8adeoKdJwIPmQpJdFmTXicYibm3YjHslPTBAao6USpdyGUnl2JLbR0QMWlrgicxtbKEA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"height: auto !important\"/></section></section><p class=\"js_pay_preview_filter\"><mp-pay-preview-filter data-offset=\"89\"></mp-pay-preview-filter></p></div>',NULL,NULL,'published',0,235,0,NULL,'2025-09-07 15:36:37','2025-09-07 23:24:37','2026-07-31 22:39:36'),(52,4,2,'我在澳门落入出码女的圈套','eboxnvv2mgdo','澳门合集第220篇（220/999）公众号秋淑曼 出品前言上午9点，蜷缩在珠海30块一晚廉价旅馆的我，被下床铺老黄打电话的哀求声吵醒：「阿弟，再借哥5000嘛，我保证…」老黄一边开口借钱，一边吞吐着有股霉味的廉价香烟。烟雾钻进我的鼻腔，我正想骂娘，往下铺一瞅，老黄床上铺满了花花绿绿的信用卡，磁条早在反复刷爆中磨得噌亮。算了，同是天涯沦落人，我今天还要过澳门，可别沾了他的霉气！我摸了摸压在枕头下的1...','<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content defaultNoSetting\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"-webkit-\"><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);visibility: visible\">澳门合集第220篇（220/999）</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);visibility: visible\"></span></p><section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.5em;\'><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-size: 17px;visibility: visible\"><br style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible\"/></span></section><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;\'><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(102, 102, 102);font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;line-height: 24px;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 8px 0px 0px;padding: 4px 10px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);border-radius: 5px;background-color: rgb(171, 219, 171);visibility: visible\">公众号</span></strong><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;line-height: 24px;color: rgb(127, 127, 127);visibility: visible\"><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible\">秋淑曼 出品</strong></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\'><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;line-height: 24px;visibility: visible;font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: rgb(2, 30, 170);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1.8px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">前言</span><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: rgb(2, 30, 170);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1.8px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span>上午9点，蜷缩在珠海30块一晚廉价旅馆的我，被下床铺老黄打电话的哀求声吵醒：</span><br/></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">「阿弟，再借哥5000嘛，我保证…」</span><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>老黄一边开口借钱，一边吞吐<span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">着有股霉味的廉价香烟。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">烟雾钻进我的鼻腔，我正想骂娘，往下铺一瞅，老黄床上铺满了花花绿绿的信用卡，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">磁条早在反复刷爆中磨得噌亮。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">算了，同是天涯沦落人，我今天还要过澳门，可别沾了他的霉气！</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我摸了摸压在枕头下的1000港币，是上次在澳门银河洗手间捡到的战利品，成为了我这次进修澳门的本钱。</span></p><p><span><span> </span></span></p><p><span><span>中午12点，跨过拱北口岸，登上澳门新东方置地酒店的免费发财车，直奔置地3楼。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我接过粉色制服女公关递来的餐券，去水吧处领了泡面，红牛，面包，这是著名的置地瘫痪「三件套」。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">看着热气腾腾的牛肉杯面，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我感慨万千。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">恍惚之际，思绪也飘回了一年前，那个被出码女套路的夏天……</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><section><section style=\"display: inline-block\"><img crossorigin=\"anonymous\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/enu35DRIiaTjTqw0QrjobY2KiaJiaYc0wabr5NCDXTXutlJFhBAWVL71f8gzszhU8H4fOGd0yzq26XojfdNfHumTg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-type=\"jpg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"height: auto !important\"/></section></section><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span></p><section><section style=\"display: inline-block\"></section><strong style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;visibility: visible\">口述｜雷梓阳</strong></section><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\'><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;line-height: 24px;visibility: visible;font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\">编辑｜茹曼怡</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">01</span><br/></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span><br/></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: rgb(2, 30, 170);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1.8px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">一年之前…</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">枫生高速上，我一脚油门踩到底，V8引擎的轰鸣声震得我耳膜发麻。</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>导航显示距离珠海还有880公里，后视镜里的南昌市郊区渐渐后退直至模糊。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>我舔了舔干燥的嘴唇，喃喃自语：</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>「澳门，我来了！」</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>8小时后，珠海拱北口岸，穿定制西装裙的澳门赌场女公关早已在黑色埃尔法旁恭候多时。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section style=\"display: inline-block\"></section><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「雷总，欢迎你的到来！」</span></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>女公关迎了上来，那真挚的笑容，足以让我忘却旅途疲惫。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">入住澳门威尼斯人酒店套房，公关还额外赠送了两张演唱会门票，此时的妈阁，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">连空气都是金钱的味道！</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">凌晨12点，我在一楼一张张败家乐赌枱之间游荡。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">夜晚的赌场就像鸡血，赌枱就是注射器，而荷官翻牌的瞬间就是针头插入的时刻，简直太爽了！</span><br/></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我在高额区转了一圈，一位和蔼可亲的圆脸荷官对我发出开工邀请，他眼角的笑纹像极了庙里供奉的弥勒佛。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我盯着电子显示屏上的路单，这靴牌开了18口，还</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">没有出现过连续两口闲，只要出了闲，重注压庄胜算很大。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">飞了两口，牌路出现了一口闲，出闲打庄，我压了1万在庄，牌开了，庄9闲3，一枪过，漂亮！</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">抓住机会，第二口继续两万押庄，一张K，一张三边，三边牌上方是数字圆头，我暗自窃喜，不是6就是8：</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「顶，顶啊，顶你个肥婆8！」</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">牌开了，庄8闲4。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">赢钱真的太容易了，一会儿功夫，三关已过，砍获7万盈利。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">这么好的路子，我正打算一鼓作气赢它个100万，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">一位马脸荷官走了过来，圆脸</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">荷官立马就跟我说：</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「不好意思喔，我收工了，老板赢多点！」</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">圆脸荷官起身离开，我看了看接班的马脸荷官，总感觉哪里不对劲，但就是说不上来。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">马脸荷官的到来，我的好运也到头了。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我两万压上庄，没想到3口连闲，庄6闲7，我输得干净利索。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我一咬牙4万继续压庄，马脸荷官邪魅一笑，我</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">心中燃起一股不祥的预感，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">这口不会也杀我吧？</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">牌开了，果然……</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">庄8闲9，庄被闲摁住强奸。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">连输两口重注，我方寸大乱，愤怒地用拳头砸在赌枱的绒毛上，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">发泄着内心的不满。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「老板，连续输，就换张枱子咯！」</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">马脸荷官缓缓抬起头，一副冷漠的表情看着我说道。</span><br/></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">或许他内心在想，你个</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">乡下仔，输两口就砸赌枱，输不起就滚蛋！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">02</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span><br/></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: rgb(2, 30, 170);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1.8px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">大波浪女孩</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">换就换！</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">我在一张美女荷官的赌枱坐下，路牌单显示这是一条单跳路，1庄1闲1庄，我把1万压上闲。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>还好，这口给了。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>正当我把2万码压上庄时，一个大波浪美女笑嘻嘻地走了过来，径直在我身旁坐下：</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>「哇老板厉害哦，一口压这么多呢！其实你玩这么大，应该上厅里打呀」</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>我面无表情，内心却有些不满，我赌的时候喜欢安静，平时也会找没人压的赌枱玩。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>像这样一个女的，虽然漂亮，干的不知道是配码抽水，还是借贵利出码的事，都是害人不浅的勾当。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>我没有理会这位献殷勤的大波浪，用下巴对着荷官一扬：</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>「开牌吧」</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>我拿了一张方块3，一张两边，抓起两边牌的一侧，慢慢地向中间翻开，这是一位澳门赌徒的自我修养。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>开牌之际，为了从我身上赚到钱的大波浪一边拍着桌子一边喊：</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>「顶，顶，顶！」</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>翻开牌，没顶出乌龟5，是4点，庄7点。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>庄7闲6，叉烧牌，又给了。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>我扔出4万压闲，荷官抻牌之际，我眼角的余光还是瞥向了大波浪。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section style=\"display: inline-block\"><img crossorigin=\"anonymous\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/enu35DRIiaTjTqw0QrjobY2KiaJiaYc0wabJicypYPVicG4wIg9agjcVjGycArC8WjjaoG5rs31Y8rXrM4mP9actmibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-ratio=\"0.5613382899628253\" data-type=\"jpg\" data-w=\"1076\" style=\"height: auto !important\"/></section></section><p><span><span></span></span><br/></p><section><section style=\"display: inline-block\"></section><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">虽然此刻我内心极度讨厌她，但我平时为人好色，可谓有女不看，罪孽如山。</span></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>在赌场金碧辉煌的灯光照耀下，卧槽！这位大波浪居然长着一副精致的小脸蛋！</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>啧啧啧！那身材更是迷人，该凸的凸，该翘的翘，一条黑色包臀裙的衬托下，两条大腿格外显白。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>荷官把闲牌推到我的面前，一张公，一张三边。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">大波浪又开始了卖力的表演，只见她俯身拍打着枱面，嘴里喊着</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">顶顶顶，我又瞄了一眼，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">角度正好窥探到衣领下面的荡漾。</span></p><p><span><span></span></span><br/></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">我的喉结忍不住滚动，但下一秒我就犯难了，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">*你妈，光顾着看，我居然忘了自己是压庄还是闲了！</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">荷官开牌，庄8闲6，当4万筹码被荷官划进筹码箱时，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我才想起，自己压的是闲。</span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">你很会顶吗？</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">顶顶顶，有本事给我也顶你两下！</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">此刻我依旧面无波澜，心底已经「问候」了这个影响我赌钱的大波浪全家。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>接着又连打几口，输了大波浪就</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">为我惋惜，赢了大波浪就赞我精神，她如此献媚目的只有一个：</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">把我带到贵宾厅洗码，或者等我洗白了，好放点贵利，压干我最后一点价值。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">可笑的是，出于男人的天性，她竟然真的在我身上赚到了钱，这是后面的事情了。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p class=\"js_pay_preview_filter\"><mp-pay-preview-filter data-offset=\"157\"></mp-pay-preview-filter></p></div>',NULL,NULL,'published',0,116,0,NULL,'2025-09-14 11:46:39','2025-09-14 11:46:39','2026-07-31 21:36:45'),(53,12,6,'【老虎机终极策略】联机老虎机 The Ultimate Slot Machine Strategy','the-ultimate-slot-machine-strategy',NULL,'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4tZrmYxWw9c',NULL,NULL,'published',0,63,0,NULL,'2026-01-09 23:28:11','2026-01-09 23:28:11','2026-07-31 22:38:46'),(54,12,6,'赶紧学！老虎机要这样下注才能赢钱','-1',NULL,'赶紧学！老虎机要这样下注才能赢钱',NULL,'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4tZrmYxWw9c','published',0,108,0,NULL,'2026-01-09 23:34:19','2026-01-09 23:34:19','2026-07-31 22:33:23'),(55,12,6,'費式數列投注法','-2',NULL,'費式數列投注法是以著名的斐波那契數列概念為基礎，衍生出的一種相對低風險、較為平穩的百家樂下注策略。和常見的馬丁格爾法相比，它並非追求“一次翻倍就能回本”，而是採用更漸進的方式，盡量減少在連輸狀態下可能遭遇的資金暴增壓力。馬丁格爾的想法是：每次輸後加倍下注，希望利用一次勝利把之前所有損失全部補回，看似能快速扭轉局面，但在面對連輸時，注碼會成倍地往上增加，一旦連輸超過預期，很可能出現資金爆炸性增長的窘境，玩家在幾口之內就承受沉重虧損加損，甚至無力繼續追加賭注。相比之下，費式數列投注的最大優點在於，它並不急於“一把回本”，而是通過前後注碼的聯繫，使每次贏局都能夠彌補前一至兩次輸局的大部分損失，從而盡量把資金的動用規模控制在較可承受的範圍內，長遠來看更適合那些想“玩的玩家、輸得少”的玩家。',NULL,'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VsxzUUFwziY','published',0,80,0,NULL,'2026-01-10 01:27:52','2026-01-10 01:27:52','2026-07-31 21:34:38'),(56,12,6,'輸最少贏最無限大！費氏數列下注','-3',NULL,'運氣也需要有科學的注碼法配合',NULL,'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a-kCpJb6PzM','published',0,94,0,NULL,'2026-01-10 01:39:17','2026-01-10 01:39:17','2026-07-31 22:33:26');
