spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);text-align: left\">编辑｜茹曼怡</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);text-align: center;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: transparent;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);text-align: center;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: transparent;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">01</span><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);text-align: center;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: transparent;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);text-align: justify\"><br style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-align: left\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(2, 30, 170);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1.8px\">鲜衣怒马少年</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-weight: bold;color: rgb(128, 99, 194)\"></span><br style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"/></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">20岁那年，我第一次踏上澳门。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">午夜时分，托官二代朋友宇哥的福，坐着埃尔法驶入拱北口岸，满脑子盘算着赢钱后是换车还是买表，睡意全无。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">直达澳门氹仔银河酒店，办理好入住，瞒着宇哥直奔赌场。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「小孩子，不能进去！」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">赌场门口的外籍保安说着蹩脚的中文，拦住了我。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);color: rgb(153, 153, 153)\">【注释：未满21周岁，赌场恕不接待】</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">返回酒店，换上巴黎世家的衬衣，抹上发蜡，头发往后倒，看起来成熟不少，夹个手包，再次返回赌场。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">这次我从与赌场相连的翠华餐厅溜进去，昂起头，顺利进入了赌场。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">好家伙！赌场内部直接把我给惊呆了，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">老虎机一排排摆在那，就像等待投喂的野兽。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">在宛如宫殿的中场里，赌徒们围在一张张败家乐赌枱前，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">一个个拍打着赌枱，声嘶力竭地喊：</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「公啊！公啊！」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">这可把我的赌瘾给吊了起来，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">找个ATM机，取了1万港币，去账房换成筹码。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><section><section style=\"display: inline-block\"><img crossorigin=\"anonymous\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/enu35DRIiaThd3RfbYWr4NTfouhSicPicn8TlDBz4TrI0MGtryc9KuYzlqreAicLlDC9YEw94icnvCLy60YFcRLZ8hw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-type=\"jpg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"height: auto !important\"/></section></section><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">攥着换好的筹码，走到一张赌枱前，随便压了2000庄，学着那些老哥们眯牌，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">把扑克牌合在一起，掀起一个角，慢慢往下翻。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">摩挲着纸牌，触感顺着指尖蔓延至全身，有一种难以言喻的畅快与带劲，就跟过山车似的。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">1万筹码，在澳门赌场里如沧海一粟，几口牌下来，就都被荷官划进了面前的珠盘。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\">输完了钱，在中场里又转悠了一圈，看其他老哥玩牌，没啥意思，回酒店休息。</p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><br/></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\">虽然输了1万，但对澳门这座赌城的印象只有俩字——天堂！</p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><br/></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\">第二天中午，跟宇哥在米其林用餐后，他说带我去一个好地方——广东会。</p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><br/></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\">我本以为是广东商会之类的机构，没想到却是赌场贵宾厅，类似于太阳城的地方。</p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">随着宇哥进入贵宾厅，保安也没向我要证件，或许只要你有钱，便可</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">轻易踏入。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><br/></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\">我俩走到一张私人赌枱，枱上堆叠着像小山的塑料泥码，便是普通人一辈子都赚不到的财富。</p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">宇哥跟枱上几位老哥打了个招呼，赌局还未开始，大家抽着烟，谈笑风生，仿佛接下来只是一场寻常的游戏。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">牌局开始，宇哥扔出10万码压闲，牌开了，庄6闲7，闲赢。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">宇哥录得开门红，脸上挂着笑，随手扔给我一枚5000的码：</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「林仔，拿去喝茶！」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><br/></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\">我有些受宠若惊，心中泛起一丝涟漪，要是我也这么有钱就好了！</p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><br/></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">豪客们赢了钱，厅里的公关便走过来讨喜钱，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">就连扫地阿姨也凑上来，笑着喊：</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「老板精神啊，赢多点哈！」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">此时贵宾厅里的空气，弥漫的都是金钱的味道。</span><br/></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">没本钱上桌的我，看得心里也痒痒的，跟宇哥撒了个谎，说累了想回酒店休息。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><br/></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\">宇哥手气正旺，也没说啥，我便下楼去中场顶赌瘾。</p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">在中场的一张赌枱坐下，运气还算不错，很快就碰上一条长庄龙。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我换了5万筹码，咬咬牙把1万压上「庄」的位置。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">荷官开牌，庄9闲7，庄赢！</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\">长龙还在继续，<span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我思索片刻，又压上2万筹码。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">荷官刚把手伸向牌靴，突然一声京腔从背后传来：</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「班长，等下！」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">这时一位老哥踱步赶来，啪的一声，往「庄」压上30万，愣是把我的看牌权给夺走了。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">那北京老哥眯牌</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">磨磨唧唧的，一时顶牌，一时喊公，折腾了几分钟，这才甩出两张庄牌——8和K，8点。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">女荷官利索地翻出对家的牌，闲牌A和8，9点！</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">北京老哥气得一拳打在赌枱上，怒吼道：</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「发的什么鬼牌！」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">长龙断了，我</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">起身离开赌枱，在其他枱子打了几口，感觉荷官在跟我作对，压庄出闲，压闲出庄，没几下手中的筹码就全部洗白了。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">ATM取不出港币了，可我舍不得就这样离开，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">去账房旁蹲着，找看起来善良的大姐，上前询问：</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「姐，我转你人民币，你给我港币，咱1：1换！」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">大姐瞅了我一眼，以为我是骗子，一句话没说，摆了摆手离开了。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我灰溜溜走进吸烟室，刚叼起一根烟，摸了摸口袋，才发现打火机被宇哥顺走了，真操蛋！</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">突然一支精致的女士打火机递了上来，给我点燃了烟：</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「帅哥，要不要换点港币？924！」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);color: rgb(153, 153, 153)\">【注释： 9240人民币兑换1万港币】</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">我抬头看了看她，一个年轻的小姐姐，我有些将信将疑，1：1换汇都被人以为是骗子，她还能吃亏？</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">后来我才知道，她是赌场里的换钱党，每换1万就能赚200汇率差。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">换好5万港币，接下来又在赌场里挣扎了两天，输输赢赢，和宇哥出关那天，我又全部输完。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><section><section style=\"display: inline-block\"><img crossorigin=\"anonymous\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/enu35DRIiaThe0ckaUbsTxoTneqMyiaib2Lx6TPapnROiaoAdVPZwb60Isqr7au6lUiajOkZK6dKcQurjdOSgLZLC1w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-type=\"jpg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"height: auto !important\"/></section></section><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);text-align: center;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: transparent;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">02</span><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-weight: 400;color: var(--weui-FG-HALF);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);text-align: center;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: transparent;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);text-align: justify\"><br style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 30, 170);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1.8px\">赌场里的扒仔</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-weight: bold;color: rgb(128, 99, 194)\"></span><br style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"/></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">回去后我跟宇哥的关系越发亲密，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">他对我十分关照，几乎每次去澳门都约我，我背地里都喊他「赌神」。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">他在澳门太阳城贵宾厅有着不败神话，一场就能赢个几十万上百万，跟捡钱似的。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\">那年五一，我刚满21周岁，和宇哥再次踏入澳门，刚好我赢了几万，心情大好，便<span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">提出请宇哥吃饭。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">在威尼斯人赌场里的餐厅，宇哥却坦言，最近几次运气不好，输了三百万，这次过来打算散散心。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">买单时宇哥又拦住了我，从LV手包掏出他的黑卡：</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「这顿饭，算我的！别跟我抢」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我心里挺感动的，宇哥这人真心能处。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">吃完饭宇哥带着我去了威尼斯人的高额区，说要打一场，找赌场报仇。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">上了赌枱，宇哥的运气那叫一个差，压哪死哪，压一口杀一口，心情坏到了极点，一位不知死活的扒仔却撞上枪口：</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「老板，我觉得下一口应该打庄！」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">扒仔的话，此刻对于烦躁的宇哥来说，无疑是刺耳的杂音。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「滚一边去！」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">宇哥突然爆发，头也没回，骂了身后的扒仔一句。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「老板，你叫谁滚?」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">面对宇哥强硬且直白的话，扒仔愣住了，不知如何回应，眼神闪过一丝慌乱。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「叫你滚！马上！」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">宇哥扭过头来，对着扒仔又是一句。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><br/></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">宇哥的大声怒吼吸引了高额区其他老哥的目光，原本喧闹的赌枱瞬</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">间安静。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">扒仔伸出食指，指着宇哥，这次并没有</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">说话，或许在用这个动作掩饰内心的尴尬。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">宇哥可不惯着他，接着骂：</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「有钱就玩，没钱不要瞎逼逼，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.578px;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">滚一边去！」</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><br/></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">听到这句，扒仔也怒火中烧：</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">「咱俩出去吧，你敢不敢和我出去？！」</span></p><p class=\"js_pay_preview_filter\"><mp-pay-preview-filter data-offset=\"170\"></mp-pay-preview-filter></p></div>',NULL,NULL,0,0,0),(10,'澳门风云故事——雷士照明吴长江（中）','https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?src=11&timestamp=1757312199&ver=6223&signature=2qPMp*B9RDNeZ2kglb3DsCEkZ*E62SbcHpM3GOQDuO2TwuypLTJa8t2YgCbooV1xaS79JloPS86QOWHECaRzWz8eR53QONh5ZDs2nCyCzjwGFS39QDGr0uP0vsf17-Z*&new=1','2025-09-08 14:17:10','一晚就赢了三个亿的吴长江，紧接着又连夜送回给了澳门，后来他过得怎么样了？上回说到，吴长江找了二十八家托底公司，2014 年又回到澳门玩。吴长江单把最高能到五千万，台上是两百万，台下乘以二十五倍托底。当天晚上，吴长江真就运气好，大获全胜把好多托底公司打得不敢接他的台底，都说这老板太牛了，纷纷表示这个台底不接了。可吴长江还想多赢点，拿着这些钱回雷士照明再搏一把，说不定能重回第一大股东的位置，因为之前输太多了。于是吴长江一看别人不接，就说，在澳门，谁要是敢借我台底，一个亿起步，吴长江信心十足，还说要玩台上两百万，台下五十倍的。当时在澳门这也算是有点小轰动，弄得大家都不敢接吴长江的台底。这时候有个人站出来了，这人就是恒升集团的老板纪晓波。那他们俩之间会有啥样的情况呢？吴长江能不能大胜恒升集团呢？咱们拭目以待！来澳门玩，一定要看一下，找小微的十大好处。【一站式解决你在澳门所有的需求】祝大哥们心想事成，红红火火！也可以看看小微的优势！来澳门玩，找小微安排，不花冤枉钱，不踩坑！往期回顾：桑拿界的世界之窗——澳门来澳门，一定要去澳门最应该去的地方','<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content defaultNoSetting\" id=\"js_content\" ><section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><img crossorigin=\"anonymous\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iaic78FUlWwrFk9J93nszn9W87mibBmZgO5mUMkNuuhVib4MDTfj3BibBXRZ5pj7PRWGatEYLnFJZEBzfugOI4wFPfw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100004510\" data-ratio=\"1.3333333333333333\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"/></section><p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(242,243,245)\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\" text><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(242,243,245)\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\" text>一晚就赢了三个亿的吴长江，紧接着又连夜送回给了澳门，后来他过得怎么样了？上回说到，吴长江找了二十八家托底公司，2014 年又回到澳门玩。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(242,243,245)\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\" text><br/></span></span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><img crossorigin=\"anonymous\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iaic78FUlWwrFk9J93nszn9W87mibBmZgO5bHG8wiaVVFzKO6zRtiaxjaPzXjHticB1c3lYCUhTVSnDS69XicMpB2ib1DA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100004511\" data-ratio=\"0.6046931407942239\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1108\" type=\"block\"/></section><p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(242,243,245)\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\" text><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(242,243,24