: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\'><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;line-height: 24px;visibility: visible;font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"></strong></span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;visibility: visible\"><span leaf=\"\">口述｜梁威林</span></strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\'><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;caret-color: rgb(7, 193, 96);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;line-height: 24px;visibility: visible;font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span leaf=\"\">编辑｜茹曼怡</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">01</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: rgb(2, 30, 170);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1.8px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">行到水穷处</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\">澳门威尼斯人的洗手间里，冷水拍在脸上的刺痛感让我清醒，镜中映着一个眼窝深陷的烂赌鬼，这还是风流倜傥的我吗？</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\">低头看了看积家上雕刻的时间，</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">我竟在威尼斯人赌了整整6个小时，输了30万！</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\">扇了自己两个大逼兜，洗手间里出来，我发誓要戒赌，掏出手机打算买一张回深圳的船票，旁边那张赌枱传来一声声：</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\">「公！公！公！」</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">赌枱围满了精神抖擞的老哥，气氛好不热闹，似乎人人都赢得盆满钵满。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">我不顾一切往里挤，牌面闲家2+4，6点，第一张庄牌5点，第二张庄牌翻开，一张红桃K，果然是公！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">全体压闲的老哥们欢呼雀跃，</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">我看了看路牌单，已经开了7口庄，6口闲。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\">好路子！下一口老哥们还是纷纷压</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\">闲追龙，荷官正要宣布</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\">截止下注，我大喊一声：</span></span><br/></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「请等一下！」</span><br/></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">说完把最后的10万港币扔上赌枱换筹码，</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\">荷官对我微笑</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\">表示欢迎，耐心地清点着现金。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">澳门荷官就是这样，可以对你笑，但基本不会和你说话。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">他们负责杀赔筹码，没有义务和赌客交流，你的输赢和他们一毛钱关系也没有。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><span leaf=\"\">这时枱上的老哥目如鹰隼锁定上我，表情中夹带一丝不满，好像我是故意捣乱他们赢钱的节奏。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">为了堵住这帮乌合之众的嘴，</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">我直接5万重注压在闲上。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><section><section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block\"><img crossorigin=\"anonymous\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/enu35DRIiaTia8iaPZNsstOaqxIV88VEnNwW2FxichFlSxfBpOpqSllnMSiandJ2Br0RT8Ru0n44AMDLg5Kn1iasgtWw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5613382899628253\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1076\" style=\"height: auto !important\"/></section></section><section><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">荷官开牌，闲3+5，8点！庄牌翻开一张牌2点，我们所有人等待收钱，对着第二张庄牌齐声高呼：</span><br/></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「班长，小小！」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">啪一声，牌开了，是棺材7，2+7，庄9点！庄赢！</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\">「我尼玛真晦气，你丫一来路子就断！」</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\">一位天津方言的老哥把手拍在赌枱上，</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">对着我埋怨道。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">或许我真的是扫把星，搭沉船，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">还剩5万，我只能一条道路走到黑！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">我又把5万压上去，开牌时老婆发来信息，问我买了回来的船票了吗？</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">我敷衍回了一句，没想到这口又输了。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">40万港币现金，输光只需要6小时25分。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">我变得急躁起来，拿出银行卡，一种立马刷卡换港币博回来的冲动直击脑门。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\">走出赌场，打了一辆的士：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「师傅，去附近的刷卡店，快！」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">妈阁是座赌城，这里很多产业都为博彩业服务，路边一个金铺，随随便便就能调动几千万的港币现金储备。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">在当铺换好10捆大黄牛（千元港币），我回到赌场，扔下几枚硬币在门口喷泉池里。</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">让自己破小财，才能在赌场里聚大财，这是一位资深老哥教我的。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><section><section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block\"><img crossorigin=\"anonymous\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/enu35DRIiaTia8iaPZNsstOaqxIV88VEnNwqOhibLk8ldDjqfjL6ll1aFh04Zvpw8osVWib7hrWoFNqeYBS1Ukvk2Lw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"height: auto !important\"/></section></section><section><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span></section><p><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><span leaf=\"\">02</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"></span><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 30, 170);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1.8px\">超级幸运7</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">我气势如虹走到一张开长庄的赌枱坐下，直视着班长（荷官），面带微笑，把1万压上庄的区域。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">此时就差周润发《赌神》电影中出场的前奏响起。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">荷官派牌，我拿起两张庄牌，直接甩在赌枱上，庄9点！那一刻感觉赌神附体，帅炸了！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">第二口两万继续压庄，庄7闲6，精神！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">第三口4万压庄，庄9闲8，又是一枪过！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">第四口，8万变16万！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">第五口，16万变32万……这路子绝了，竟然是天路！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「哇，老板真有魄力！」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「过5关啊！精神！」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「哎，我要敢这么压就好了！」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">……</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">赌枱上其他老哥的恭维声仿佛把我捧到了云端，真是行到水穷处，坐看云起时！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">我没有被胜利冲昏头脑，不敢继续追龙，收好筹码，起身在赌场的过道买了一包和天下。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">内地100块，赌场里要330澳门元，真踏马黑！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img crossorigin=\"anonymous\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/enu35DRIiaTia8iaPZNsstOaqxIV88VEnNwCgLhBXSZkJEdmERBTLCAnrQxVlcic5jElibh8GykzMicRyKjngxiahwPDg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.2138888888888888\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"height: auto !important\"/></section></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">不过也无所谓了，我此时的小目标是赢100万。</span><br/></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">我又就近选了一张赌枱，看了眼路牌单的一闲三庄一闲，我认为接下来必定开庄，而且会连庄，起注就3万押在了庄。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">荷官派牌，闲赢！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">输3万不痛不痒，扔上6万继续压庄，荷官再次派牌，我开始有些兴奋，想着这次肯定能赢下6万。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">我拿到一张Q，一张四边，慢慢掀开四边牌，嘴里喊着：</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「吹啊！吹！」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">掀开1/3没看到头，我跳起把牌用力一甩，果然是张9！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">一鼓作气，我把15万直接压庄，《赌神》电影的音乐在心中再次响起。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「老板，你确定吗？15万？」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">对面的女荷官有点懵，或许很长一段时间没有看到过这样的客人了，心里肯定想，这个烂赌鬼肯定是输了不少，急于翻本。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「确定，派牌吧！」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">我有些迫不及待。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">荷官干净利落几秒就完成开牌，庄3点，闲6点，闲赢。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">怎么又是闲？！我紧张起来，但很快安慰自己，下一口指定是庄，把最后28万码梭哈压上庄。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「老板，不要压这么大啦，机会还是有的嘛」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">女荷官安慰我一句。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">我并没有理会荷官，对她招手：</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「班长，直接开，我不看牌」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">女荷官看了看我，一张一张的把牌翻开，庄7闲6，7叉6，庄赢。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「Yes！赢了！」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">我兴奋地对着女荷官做了个胜利的手势，女荷官却一头雾水，不解地说：</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「老板，这口你输了啊，你压的是闲啊！」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「啊？不可能啊！」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">我不可置信地看向赌枱，看到压在闲区域的28万码，我瞪大了眼睛，我明明压的是庄，怎么会？！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">我的脑子一片空白，玛德！赌博果然没有好结果！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">我如同一具枯槁往赌场出口走去，想掏出手机，在包里来回翻动了两遍，手突然触摸到一个比硬币大的玩意，掏出来一看，竟是一枚5000的筹码！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">啥时候落在包里了？</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">捧着这枚被遗忘的筹码，我内心毫无波澜，49万都输了，5000连点浪花都掀不起来。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">就像星际大战，对手都开着飞船杀来，我手中的沙漠之鹰只剩最后一颗子弹，我能做的，就是赏自己一个痛快。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">此时夜幕降临，我麻木地把那枚筹码压在赌场出口那张赌枱的「幸运7」上。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">心如死灰地看着荷官的手指在扑克牌上飞舞，我只想着快点输完，好回深圳，努力工作还债。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">荷官开牌，看到闲1点，庄6点，我内心突然咯噔一下。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">闲要补牌，荷官翻开闲补之际，我心里嘀咕，不会是骨灰6吧？！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">闲补被翻开，还真的是一张6！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">根据规则，庄也要补一张，</span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">难道有戏？！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">荷官正要翻开庄补，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">我再也压抑不住激动的心情：</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">「公！公啊！公啊！！」</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">牌开了，庄补一张Q！</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\">闲A+J+6，7点，庄K+6+Q，6点，我压中了超级幸运7！100倍！</span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">5000变50万！妈阁从不缺</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">奇迹！</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">荷官也向我祝贺：</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「啧啧啧，靓仔，真系好彩喔！」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><section><section style=\"display: inline-block\"></section><span style=\"background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND)\">绝地求生，我的内心又开始骚动，在冲击赢100万的小目标之前，我要发泄一股征服的欲望。</span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);letter-spacing: 0.034em\">收好筹码，我快步走出赌场，拦下一辆的士车：</span><br/></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">「师傅，麻烦去十八桑拿！」</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img crossorigin=\"anonymous\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/enu35DRIiaTh9KiaoWgWWAmJ8GMIM65apUicXAiaNKnia3IicG3FnOGxkgVv0ada4d9JnicZxnDf2q8icR5UGk8xECZKWA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562037037037037\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"height: auto !important\"/></section><p class=\"js_pay_preview_filter\"><mp-pay-preview-filter data-offset=\"199\"></mp-pay-preview-filter></p></section></div>','','',2334,191,4),(14,'我在澳门落入出码女的圈套','https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3Nzk3NTc4MQ==&mid=2247497848&idx=1&sn=a1e81f748f369a5c76ddd7e610e16c1c&chksm=cf1879f2f86ff0e473c97e1ce5d878dadc68c34912e4ebe48f7bf27dbb41b91cf202f5126030&scene=178&cur_album_id=3144167533121126402&search_click_id=#rd','2025-09-14 19:03:35','澳门合集第220篇（220/999）公众号秋淑曼 出品前言上午9点，蜷缩在珠海30块一晚廉价旅馆的我，被下床铺老黄打电话的哀求声吵醒：「阿弟，再借哥5000嘛，我保证…」老黄一边开口借钱，一边吞吐着有股霉味的廉价香烟。烟雾钻进我的鼻腔，我正想骂娘，往下铺一瞅，老黄床上铺满了花花绿绿的信用卡，磁条早在反复刷爆中磨得噌亮。算了，同是天涯沦落人，我今天还要过澳门，可别沾了他的霉气！我摸了摸压在枕头下的1000港币，是上次在澳门银河洗手间捡到的战利品，成为了我这次进修澳门的本钱。中午12点，跨过拱北口岸，登上澳门新东方置地酒店的免费发财车，直奔置地3楼。我接过粉色制服女公关递来的餐券，去水吧处领了泡面，红牛，面包，这是著名的置地瘫痪「三件套」。看着热气腾腾的牛肉杯面，我感慨万千。恍惚之际，思绪也飘回了一年前，那个被出码女套路的夏天……口述｜雷梓阳编辑｜茹曼怡01一年之前…枫生高速上，我一脚油门踩到底，V8引擎的轰鸣声震得我耳膜发麻。导航显示距离珠海还有880公里，后视镜里的南昌市郊区渐渐后退直至模糊。我舔了舔干燥的嘴唇，喃喃自语：「澳门，我来了！」8小时后，珠海拱北口岸，穿定制西装裙的澳门赌场女公关早已在黑色埃尔法旁恭候多时。「雷总，欢迎你的到来！」女公关迎了上来，那真挚的笑容，足以让我忘却旅途疲惫。入住澳门威尼斯人酒店套房，公关还额外赠送了两张演唱会门票，此时的妈阁，连空气都是金钱的味道！凌晨12点，我在一楼一张张败家乐赌枱之间游荡。夜晚的赌场就像鸡血，赌枱就是注射器，而荷官翻牌的瞬间就是针头插入的时刻，简直太爽了！我在高额区转了一圈，一位和蔼可亲的圆脸荷官对我发出开工邀请，他眼角的笑纹像极了庙里供奉的弥勒佛。我盯着电子显示屏上的路单，这靴牌开了18口，还没有出现过连续两口闲，只要出了闲，重注压庄胜算很大。飞了两口，牌路出现了一口闲，出闲打庄，我压了1万在庄，牌开了，庄9闲3，一枪过，漂亮！抓住机会，第二口继续两万押庄，一张K，一张三边，三边牌上方是数字圆头，我暗自窃喜，不是6就是8：「顶，顶啊，顶你个肥婆8！」牌开了，庄8闲4。赢钱真的太容易了，一会儿功夫，三关已过，砍获7万盈利。这么好的路子，我正打算一鼓作气赢它个100万，一位马脸荷官走了过来，圆脸荷官立马就跟我说：「不好意思喔，我收工了，老板赢多点！」圆脸荷官起身离开，我看了看接班的马脸荷官，总感觉哪里不对劲，但就是说不上来。马脸荷官的到来，我的好运也到头了。我两万压上庄，没想到3口连闲，庄6闲7，我输得干净利索。我一咬牙4万继续压庄，马脸荷官邪魅一笑，我心中燃起一股不祥的预感，这口不会也杀我吧？牌开了，果然……庄8闲9，庄被闲摁住强奸。连输两口重注，我方寸大乱，愤怒地用拳头砸在赌枱的绒毛上，发泄着内心的不满。「老板，连续输，就换张枱子咯！」马脸荷官缓缓抬起头，一副冷漠的表情看着我说道。或许他内心在想，你个乡下仔，输两口就砸赌枱，输不起就滚蛋！02大波浪女孩换就换！我在一张美女荷官的赌枱坐下，路牌单显示这是一条单跳路，1庄1闲1庄，我把1万压上闲。还好，这口给了。正当我把2万码压上庄时，一个大波浪美女笑嘻嘻地走了过来，径直在我身旁坐下：「哇老板厉害哦，一口压这么多呢！其实你玩这么大，应该上厅里打呀」我面无表情，内心却有些不满，我赌的时候喜欢安静，平时也会找没人压的赌枱玩。像这样一个女的，虽然漂亮，干的不知道是配码抽水，还是借贵利出码的事，都是害人不浅的勾当。我没有理会这位献殷勤的大波浪，用下巴对着荷官一扬：「开牌吧」我拿了一张方块3，一张两边，抓起两边牌的一侧，慢慢地向中间翻开，这是一位澳门赌徒的自我修养。开牌之际，为了从我身上赚到钱的大波浪一边拍着桌子一边喊：「顶，顶，顶！」翻开牌，没顶出乌龟5，是4点，庄7点。庄7闲6，叉烧牌，又给了。我扔出4万压闲，荷官抻牌之际，我眼角的余光还是瞥向了大波浪。虽然此刻我内心极度讨厌她，但我平时为人好色，可谓有女不看，罪孽如山。在赌场金碧辉煌的灯光照耀下，卧槽！这位大波浪居然长着一副精致的小脸蛋！啧啧啧！那身材更是迷人，该凸的凸，该翘的翘，一条黑色包臀裙的衬托下，两条大腿格外显白。荷官把闲牌推到我的面前，一张公，一张三边。大波浪又开始了卖力的表演，只见她俯身拍打着枱面，嘴里喊着顶顶顶，我又瞄了一眼，角度正好窥探到衣领下面的荡漾。我的喉结忍不住滚动，但下一秒我就犯难了，*你妈，光顾着看，我居然忘了自己是压庄还是闲了！荷官开牌，庄8闲6，当4万筹码被荷官划进筹码箱时，我才想起，自己压的是闲。你很会顶吗？顶顶顶，有本事给我也顶你两下！此刻我依旧面无波澜，心底已经「问候」了这个影响我赌钱的大波浪全家。接着又连打几口，输了大波浪就为我惋惜，赢了大波浪就赞我精神，她如此献媚目的只有一个：把我带到贵宾厅洗码，或者等我洗白了，好放点贵利，压干我最后一点价值。可笑的是，出于男人的天性，她竟然真的在我身上赚到了钱，这是后面的事情了。','<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content defaultNoSetting\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"-webkit-\"><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: left;background-color: transparent;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);visibility: visible\">澳门合集第220篇（220/999）</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: transparent;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND);visibility: visible\"></span></p><section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-si